1
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:20,240
Mo Wenshan actually dared to absorb the yang energy of living people

2
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:22,360
to rejuvenate himself.

3
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:33,000
Master.

4
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:35,850
Martial Nephew, you're finally here.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,920
The Patriarch's vitality is enough.

6
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:40,920
He only needs the method of Yin-Yang integration to return to the world.

7
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:42,380
I'll give you two choices.

8
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:44,130
Hand over the core of Yang Arts,

9
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:47,040
or watch your master become the last sacrifice.

10
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:52,280
I choose neither.

11
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:55,360
Still too young.

12
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:57,240
Then let me show you

13
00:00:57,600 --> 00:01:00,600
what the Mo family has pursued for three generations.

14
00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:04,120
The Twelve Yuanchen Formation.

15
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:05,840
It's to gather vitality

16
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:07,320
and integrate Yin and Yang.

17
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:09,180
You are all his blood sacrifices.

18
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:10,320
Shield One, Ruler Nine,

19
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:10,960
Flying Bird,

20
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:12,020
protect everyone.

21
00:01:31,960 --> 00:01:33,240
He hasn't truly integrated.

22
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:34,160
Every nine breaths,

23
00:01:34,160 --> 00:01:36,220
the Yin and Yang paths will separate.

24
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:46,800
Nine breaths.

25
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:49,160
You really saw it.

26
00:01:49,160 --> 00:01:50,039
And then?

27
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,360
Retreat.

28
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:31,660
The successor of Yang Arts

29
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:33,180
is nothing more than this.

30
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:34,100
Enough.

31
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:46,840
Mo Wenshan, stop being so stubborn.

32
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:49,240
Xuanchen, you still have power.

33
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:50,560
Qinghe.

34
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,160
I'm fine.

35
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,200
How much longer for your formation?

36
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:57,000
Five breaths.

37
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,400
That's enough time.

38
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:03,640
Xiaotang,

39
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:06,000
the Chou Pillar is weaker than the others.

40
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:06,640
Understood.

41
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:07,500
Martial Uncle.

42
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:12,280
Qinghe.

43
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:14,840
Did you see his weakness?

44
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:16,200
I saw it.

45
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:18,840
The Twelve Yuanchen Formation was never completed.

46
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,840
For three generations of your Mo family,

47
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:23,440
no one has truly integrated Yin and Yang.

48
00:03:23,640 --> 00:03:24,200
So,

49
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:25,640
you being hunted by me,

50
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:26,760
and finally caught,

51
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:28,040
was actually to enter the anomaly yourself

52
00:03:28,040 --> 00:03:29,640
to break my Twelve Yuanchen.

53
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:32,690
The formation is ready.

54
00:03:33,640 --> 00:03:34,760
Let's begin.

55
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:08,100
There's one last step.

56
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:10,240
Place Kan and Li at the top of the Taiji Pillar at the same time.

57
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:12,320
No matter what you see, don't let go.

58
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:14,680
Understood.

59
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:23,960
This is the core of Yang Arts the Mo family wants to see.

60
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:27,520
Xiaotang, cover the node pieces.

61
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:29,780
Su Wan, hold the line outside the pillar.

62
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,490
Qinghe, be careful.

63
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:40,090
He is the Mo family's Patriarch, Mo Wuhen.

64
00:04:41,159 --> 00:04:42,420
Kan and Li, integrate.

65
00:04:49,159 --> 00:04:49,600
Su Wan,

66
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,460
expand the line by three feet.

67
00:04:53,159 --> 00:04:54,040
Xiaotang,

68
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,170
the root on the left.

69
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:09,000
Master, I did it.

70
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:16,640
The Taiji Pillar

71
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:19,080
will send back all the vitality he absorbed.

72
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:20,160
He won't last long.

73
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:27,080
How is this possible?

74
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:41,120
Patriarch.

75
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,240
Pa...

76
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:47,640
Chen Qinghe,

77
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:49,810
how dare you hurt my father!

78
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:54,530
Shield One, Ruler Nine, Qingling.

79
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:09,240
Yun'er.

80
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:24,320
Wenshan.

81
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:27,480
Stop. I won't kill you.

82
00:06:32,440 --> 00:06:33,570
This ring talisman,

83
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:36,520
you practiced for three days back then and still couldn't carve it well.

84
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:38,040
You threw your knife in frustration.

85
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,760
I made you start over from the first stroke.

86
00:06:39,760 --> 00:06:40,640
Stop talking.

87
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:46,360
Mo Wuhen,

88
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:48,440
how much longer are you going to hide?

89
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:49,800
How much longer?

90
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,000
It's been 300 years.

91
00:07:32,440 --> 00:07:34,840
Did you think that by drawing out my life force,

92
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:36,159
I would disappear?

93
00:07:40,440 --> 00:07:41,640
Why?
